title: Presidential Election
subtitle: [? if hindenburg_run: Hindenburg runs for re-election... ?][? if not hindenburg_run: The first round results have come in... ?]
view-if: year = 1932 and month >= 3 and presidential_election_1932_seen = 0
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: presidential_election_1932_seen = 1; next_presidential_election_year = year + 7; next_presidential_election_month = month;
tags: event
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: pres_election
face-image: img/hindenburg_election.jpg

@pres_election

The presidential election's first round is set to take place this month. If no candidate secures a majority, a second round will be held, with the candidate receiving the most votes winning the presidency.

- @final_election: The first round results...

@final_election
on-arrival: election_round = 0
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: post_election



@post_election
on-arrival: {!
Q.bvp_votes = Q.bvp_votes / 100;

Q.reactionary_votes = 0;
Q.second_reactionary_votes = 0;
Q.dvp_candidate_votes = 0;
Q.spd_candidate_votes = 0;
Q.harzburg_votes = 0;
Q.hitler_votes = 0;
Q.thalmann_votes = 0;

// initial phase:
Q.hitler_votes += Q.nsdap_normalized;
Q.thalmann_votes += Q.kpd_normalized;
if (Q.sapd_candidate == "Thälmann" && Q.sapd_formed) Q.thalmann_votes += Q.sapd_normalized;

if (Q.dnvp_candidate == "Duesterberg") Q.harzburg_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
if (Q.dnf_candidate == "Duesterberg" && Q.dnf_formed) Q.harzburg_votes += Q.dnf_normalized;

if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
if (Q.z_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.csvd_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.csvd_normalized;
if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.wp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.wp_normalized;
if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.cnblp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.cnblp_normalized;
if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.kvp_formed) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.kvp_normalized;
if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.dnvp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
if (Q.other_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.other_normalized;

if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
if (Q.z_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.second_reactionary_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate && Q.csvd_exist) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.csvd_normalized;
if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate && Q.wp_exist) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.wp_normalized;
if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate && Q.cnblp_exist) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.cnblp_normalized;
if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate && Q.kvp_formed) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.kvp_normalized;
if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate && Q.dnvp_exist) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
if (Q.other_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.second_reactionary_votes += Q.other_normalized;

if (Q.dvp_candidate == "Eckener" || Q.dvp_candidate == "Luther" || Q.dvp_candidate == "Jarres") {
    Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.csvd_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.csvd_normalized;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.wp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.wp_normalized;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.cnblp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.cnblp_normalized;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.kvp_formed) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.kvp_normalized;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.dnvp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
}

if (Q.spd_campaign) {
    Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate && Q.csrp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.spd_candidate) Q.spd_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
}


// check for majority
Q.reactionary_votes = Math.round(Q.reactionary_votes*1000)/10;
Q.second_reactionary_votes = Math.round(Q.second_reactionary_votes*1000)/10;
Q.dvp_candidate_votes = Math.round(Q.dvp_candidate_votes*1000)/10;
Q.spd_candidate_votes = Math.round(Q.spd_candidate_votes*1000)/10;
Q.harzburg_votes = Math.round(Q.harzburg_votes*1000)/10;
Q.hitler_votes = Math.round(Q.hitler_votes*1000)/10;
Q.thalmann_votes = Math.round(Q.thalmann_votes*1000)/10;

Q.reactionary_majority = 0;
Q.second_reactionary_majority = 0;
Q.dvp_candidate_majority = 0;
Q.spd_candidate_majority = 0;
Q.thalmann_majority = 0;
Q.harzburg_majority = 0;
Q.hitler_majority = 0;

Q.reactionary_plurality = 0;
Q.second_reactionary_plurality = 0;
Q.dvp_candidate_plurality = 0;
Q.spd_candidate_plurality = 0;
Q.thalmann_plurality = 0;
Q.harzburg_plurality = 0;
Q.hitler_plurality = 0;

Q.reactionary_majority = (Q.reactionary_votes >= 50);
Q.second_reactionary_majority = (Q.second_reactionary_votes >= 50);
Q.dvp_candidate_majority = (Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= 50);
Q.spd_candidate_majority = (Q.spd_candidate_votes >= 50);
Q.thalmann_majority = (Q.thalmann_votes >= 50);
Q.harzburg_majority = (Q.harzburg_votes >= 50);
Q.hitler_majority = (Q.hitler_votes >= 50);
Q.any_majority = Q.reactionary_majority | Q.eckener_majority | Q.braun_majority | Q.harzburg_majority | Q.thalmann_majority | Q.hitler_majority;

// check for plurality
if (Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.second_reactionary_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.dvp_candidate_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.spd_candidate_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.harzburg_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.reactionary_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.second_reactionary_votes >= Q.dvp_candidate_votes && Q.second_reactionary_votes >= Q.spd_candidate_votes && Q.second_reactionary_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.second_reactionary_votes >= Q.harzburg_votes && Q.second_reactionary_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.second_reactionary_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.spd_candidate_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.harzburg_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.dvp_candidate_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.harzburg_votes && Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.spd_candidate_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.thalmann_votes >= Q.harzburg_votes && Q.thalmann_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.thalmann_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.harzburg_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.harzburg_plurality = 1;
} else {
    Q.hitler_plurality = 1;
}
// If no candidate gets above 50%, then there's a second round. In the second round, a plurality wins. 
Q.election_round += 1;
Q.new_candidate_r2 = 0;

// making the vote numbers nicer for the display
Q.reactionary_votes_disp = Q.reactionary_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.second_reactionary_votes_disp = Q.second_reactionary_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.dvp_candidate_votes_disp = Q.dvp_candidate_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.spd_candidate_votes_disp = Q.spd_candidate_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.harzburg_votes_disp = Q.harzburg_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.hitler_votes_disp = Q.hitler_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.thalmann_votes_disp = Q.thalmann_votes.toFixed(1);
!}
go-to: hindenburg_wins if reactionary_majority and reactionary_candidate == "Hindenburg"; adenauer_wins if (reactionary_majority and reactionary_candidate == "Adenauer") or (second_reactionary_majority and second_reactionary_candidate == "Adenauer"); bruning_wins if (reactionary_majority and reactionary_candidate == "Brüning") or (second_reactionary_majority and second_reactionary_candidate == "Brüning"); stegerwald_wins if (reactionary_majority and reactionary_candidate == "Stegerwald") or (second_reactionary_majority and second_reactionary_candidate == "Stegerwald"); westarp_wins if (reactionary_majority and reactionary_candidate == "Westarp") or (second_reactionary_majority and second_reactionary_candidate == "Westarp"); lettow_vorbeck_wins if (reactionary_majority and reactionary_candidate == "Lettow-Vorbeck") or (second_reactionary_majority and second_reactionary_candidate == "Lettow-Vorbeck"); eckener_wins if dvp_candidate_majority and dvp_candidate == "Eckener"; luther_wins if dvp_candidate_majority and dvp_candidate == "Luther"; jarres_wins if dvp_candidate_majority and dvp_candidate == "Jarres"; braun_wins if spd_candidate_majority and spd_candidate == "Braun"; rosenfeld_wins if spd_candidate_majority and spd_candidate == "Rosenfeld"; thalmann_wins if thalmann_majority == 1; hitler_wins if hitler_majority == 1; duesterberg_wins if harzburg_majority == 1; no_majority_round1 if any_majority == 0 and election_round == 1

Results:

[? if dvp_candidate == "Eckener": **Hugo** <span style="color: #000000;">**Ec**</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">**ken**</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">**er**</span> - [+ dvp_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?][? if dvp_candidate == "Luther": <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**Hans Luther**</span> - [+ dvp_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?][? if dvp_candidate == "Jarres": <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**Karl Jarres**</span> - [+ dvp_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?]

<span style="color: var(--kpd-color);">**Thälmann**</span> - [+ thalmann_votes_disp +]%

[? if spd_campaign: [? if spd_candidate == "Braun": <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**Otto Braun**</span> ?][? if spd_candidate == "Rosenfeld": <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**Kurt Rosenfeld**</span> ?] - [+ spd_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if reactionary_candidate == "Hindenburg": <span style="color: #808080;">**Paul von Hindenburg**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Adenauer": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Konrad Adenauer**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Brüning": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Heinrich Brüning**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Stegerwald": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Adam Stegerwald**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Vorbeck": <span style="color: #808080;">**Paul von Lettow-Vorbeck**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if reactionary_candidate = "Westarp": <span style="color: var(--dnvp-color);">**Kuno von Westarp**</span> - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if second_reactionary_candidate = "Adenauer": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Konrad Adenauer**</span> - [+ second_reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if second_reactionary_candidate = "Brüning": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Heinrich Brüning**</span> - [+ second_reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if second_reactionary_candidate = "Stegerwald": <span style="color: var(--z-color);">**Adam Stegerwald**</span> - [+ second_reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if second_reactionary_candidate = "Vorbeck": <span style="color: #808080;">**Paul von Lettow-Vorbeck**</span> - [+ second_reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?][? if second_reactionary_candidate = "Westarp": <span style="color: var(--dnvp-color);">**Kuno von Westarp**</span> - [+ second_reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if dnvp_candidate = "Duesterberg": <span style="color: var(--dnvp-color);">**Duesterberg**</span> ?][? if dnf_candidate = "Duesterberg" and dnf_formed: <span style="color: #003755;">**Duesterberg**</span> ?] - [+ harzburg_votes_disp +]%

<span style="color: #954B00;">**[+ nsdap_candidate +]**</span> - [+ hitler_votes_disp +]%

@no_majority_round1
on-arrival: {!
Q.presidential_election_r2_trigger = 1;

if (Q.dnvp_candidate == "Duesterberg" || Q.dnf_candidate == "Duesterberg") Q.duesterberg_r1 = 1;

if (Q.second_reactionary_votes > reactionary_votes) {
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.spd_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.other_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.other_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    Q.reactionary_candidate = Q.second_reactionary_candidate;
    Q.second_reactionary_candidate = 0;
} else {
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.spd_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.other_candidate == Q.second_reactionary_candidate) Q.other_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
}
if (Q.reactionary_candidate == "Hindenburg") {
    if (Q.braun_plurality || Q.dvp_candidate_plurality || Q.thalmann_plurality) {
        Q.nsdap_candidate = "Hindenburg";
    } else {
        if (Q.dnvp_candidate == "Duesterberg") Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.nsdap_candidate;
        if (Q.dnf_candidate == "Duesterberg") Q.dnf_candidate = Q.nsdap_candidate;
    }
}

Q.spd_was_campaign = 0;
if ((Q.hitler_plurality || Q.harzburg_plurality) && Q.spd_campaign && Q.reactionary_candidate != "Westarp") {
    Q.spd_campaign = 0;
    Q.spd_was_campaign = 1;
}
if (!Q.spd_campaign && Q.ddp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
if (!Q.spd_campaign && Q.csrp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
if (!Q.spd_campaign && Q.z_candidate == Q.spd_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
if (!Q.spd_campaign) Q.spd_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;

!}
go-to: round2_menu

There is no majority in this round. In the second round, any candidate who wins a plurality will win overall. What should we do?

[? if duesterberg_r1: Following last month’s events, Duesterberg has withdrawn from the race. ?]

[? if second_reactionary_candidate != 0: The Bourgeois vote has consolidated around [+ reactionary_candidate +] ?]

[? if (spd_candidate_plurality or dvp_candidate_plurality or thalmann_plurality) and reactionary_candidate = "Hindenburg": In order to consolidate the vote for the Right, and to prevent a [? if spd_candidate_plurality or dvp_candidate_plurality: republican ?][? if thalmann_plurality: communist ?] from becoming president, [+ nsdap_candidate +] is no longer running in the second round, and has switched his endorsement to [+ reactionary_candidate +]. ?]

[? if (hitler_plurality or harzburg_plurality) and spd_was_campaign: In order to consolidate the vote for the Republicans, and to prevent a memebr of the Far-Right from becoming president, the <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> is no longer fielding a candidate in the second round, and has switched its endorsement to [+ spd_candidate +]. ?]


@round2_menu

- @round2_stay_on_the_race: Stay on the race.
- @round2_spd: Switch our support to [+ spd_candidate +].
- @round2_reactionary: Switch our support to [+ reactionary_candidate +].

@round2_stay_on_the_race
go-to: round2_endorsements

@round2_spd
view-if: spd_candidate == "Braun" and dvp_candidate != spd_candidate
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dbp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    Q.dvp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    Q.dvp_campaign = 0;
!}

@round2_reactionary
view-if: dvp_candidate != reactionary_candidate and reactionary_candidate != 0
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.spd_campaign && Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) {
        Q.ddp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    } else {
        Q.ddp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    }
    if (Q.spd_campaign && Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) {
        Q.dbp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    } else {
        Q.dbp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    }
    if (Q.spd_campaign && Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) {
        Q.csrp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    } else {
        Q.csrp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    }
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    Q.dvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    Q.dvp_campaign = 0;
!}


@round2_endorsements

- @round2_convince_spd: Convince the [+ spd_name +] to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_ddp: Convince the [+ ddp_name +] to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_dbp: Convince the DBP to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_csrp: Convince the CSRP to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_z: Convince the [+ z_name +] to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_csvd: Convince the CSVD to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_wp: Convince the WP to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_cnblp: Convince the CNBLP to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_kvp: Convince the KVP to switch their support to us.
- @round2_convince_dnvp: Convince the [+ dnvp_name +] to switch their support to us.
- @round2_vote: Let the second round voting begin.


@round2_convince_spd
view-if: spd_candidate != dvp_candidate and dvp_candidate != "Westarp"
choose-if: spd_votes < (antidem_votes - kpd_votes) and (dvp_candidate == "Luther" or dvp_candidate == "Eckener")
unavailable-subtitle: The Social Democrats are stronger than the far-right. [? if dvp_candidate == "Jarres": They are not satisfied with our candidate choice. ?]
go-to: r2_spd_failed if spd_relation < 40; r2_spd_success if spd_relation >= 40
max-visits: 1

@r2_spd_success
on-arrival: spd_candidate = dvp_candidate; ddp_candidate = dvp_candidate if spd_campaign; dbp_candidate = dvp_candidate if spd_campaign; csrp_candidate = dvp_candidate if spd_campaign; z_candidate = dvp_candidate if z_candidate = "Braun"; spd_relation += 3
go-to: round2_menu

The [+ spd_name +] are convinced! They will be part of the [+ dvp_candidate +] coalition.

@r2_spd_failed
on-arrival: spd_relation -= 3
go-to: round2_menu

Unfortunately, we fail to turn them away from [+ spd_candidate +].


@round2_convince_ddp
view-if: ddp_candidate != dvp_candidate and ddp_exist
go-to: r2_ddp_failed if ddp_relation < 35; r2_ddp_success if ddp_relation >= 35
max-visits: 1

@r2_ddp_success
on-arrival: ddp_candidate = dvp_candidate; ddp_relation += 5
go-to: round2_menu

The [+ ddp_name +] are convinced! They will be part of the [+ dvp_candidate +] coalition.

@r2_ddp_failed
on-arrival: ddp_relation -= 5
go-to: round2_menu

Unfortunately, we fail to turn them away from [+ ddp_candidate +].


@round2_convince_dbp
view-if: dbp_candidate != dvp_candidate and dbp_exist
go-to: r2_dbp_failed if dbp_relation < 35; r2_dbp_success if dbp_relation >= 35
max-visits: 1

@r2_dbp_success
on-arrival: dbp_candidate = dbp_candidate; dbp_relation += 3
go-to: round2_menu

The DBP are convinced! They will be part of the [+ dvp_candidate +] coalition.

@r2_dbp_failed
on-arrival: dbp_relation -= 3
go-to: round2_menu

Unfortunately, we fail to turn them away from [+ dbp_candidate +].


@round2_convince_csrp
view-if: csrp_candidate != dvp_candidate and csrp_exist
go-to: r2_csrp_failed if csrp_relation < 45; r2_csrp_success if csrp_relation >= 45
max-visits: 1

@r2_csrp_success
on-arrival: csrp_candidate = dvp_candidate; csrp_relation += 3
go-to: round2_menu

The CSRP are convinced! They will be part of the [+ dvp_candidate +] coalition.

@r2_csrp_failed
on-arrival: csrp_relation -= 3
go-to: round2_menu

Unfortunately, we fail to turn them away from [+ csrp_candidate +].


@round2_convince_z
view-if: z_candidate != dvp_candidate and (cvp_formed == 0 or dvp_candidate != "Braun")
go-to: r2_z_failed if z_relation < 35; r2_z_success if z_relation >= 35
max-visits: 1

@r2_z_success
on-arrival: {! 
    Q.z_relation += 3;
    Q.z_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
    if (Q.reactionary_candidate == "Adenauer" || Q.reactionary_candidate == "Brüning" || Q.reactionary_candidate == "Stegerwald") {
        if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.spd_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate
        if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
    }
!}
go-to: round2_menu

The [+ z_name +] are convinced! They will be part of the [+ dvp_candidate +] coalition. [? if bvp_candidate = dvp_candidate: BVP will also support our candidate. ?]

@r2_z_failed
on-arrival: z_relation -= 3
go-to: round2_menu

Unfortunately, we fail to turn them away from [+ z_candidate +].


@round2_convince_csvd
view-if: csvd_candidate != dvp_candidate and csvd_exist and dvp_candidate != "Braun"
go-to: r2_csvd_failed if csvd_relation < 35; r2_csvd_success if csvd_relation >= 35
max-visits: 1

@r2_csvd_success
on-arrival: csvd_candidate = dvp_candidate; csvd_relation += 3
go-to: round2_menu

The CSVD are convinced! They will be part of the [+ dvp_candidate +] coalition.

@r2_csvd_failed
