@round2_convince_dnvp
view-if: dnvp_candidate != dvp_candidate and dnvp_exist and dnvp_left >= 0 and dvp_candidate != "Braun"
go-to: r2_dnvp_failed if dnvp_relation < 45; r2_dnvp_success if dnvp_relation >= 45
max-visits: 1

@r2_dnvp_success
on-arrival: {! 
    Q.dnvp_relation += 3;
    Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
    if (Q.reactionary_candidate == "Westarp") {
        if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate
        if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.z_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
        if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.dvp_candidate;
    }
!}
go-to: round2_menu

The DNVP are convinced! They will be part of the [+ dvp_candidate +] coalition.

@r2_dnvp_failed
on-arrival: dnvp_relation -= 3
go-to: round2_menu

Unfortunately, we fail to turn them away from [+ dnvp_candidate +].


@round2_vote

Hopefully Germany makes the right choice.


@hindenburg_wins
on-arrival: president = "Hindenburg"; president_party = "I"

As expected, the incumbent Hindenburg wins the presidency.

@adenauer_wins
on-arrival: president = "Adenauer"; president_party = z_name; catholics_z += 3; new_middle_z += 5; old_middle_z += 5;

Konrad Adenauer has won the presidency.

@bruning_wins
on-arrival: president = "Brüning"; president_party = z_name; catholics_z += 7;

Heinrich Brüning has won the presidency.

@stegerwald_wins
on-arrival: president = "Stegerwald"; president_party = z_name; catholics_z += 2; new_middle_z += 4; old_middle_z += 4; workers_z += 4;

Adam Stegerwald has won the presidency.

@westarp_wins
on-arrival: president = "Westarp"; president_party = "KVP" if kvp_formed; president_party = dnvp_name if dnvp_left >= 0; new_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; new_middle_dnvp += 7 if  dnvp_left >= 0; old_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; old_middle_dnvp += 7 if  dnvp_left >= 0; rural_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; rural_dnvp += 7 if  dnvp_left >= 0

Count Kuno von Westarp, one of the most famous figures of the nationalist Right, has been elected president.

@lettow_vorbeck_wins
on-arrival: president = "Lettow-Vorbeck"; president_party = "KVP" if kvp_formed; president_party = dnvp_name if dnvp_left >= 0; new_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; new_middle_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0; old_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; old_middle_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0; rural_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; rural_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0;

Paul von Lettow-Vorbeck, a nationalist not far different from Hindenburg, has been elected president.

@eckener_wins
on-arrival: president = "Eckener"; president_party = "I"; new_middle_dvp += 7*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 7*(1-dissent)

Nationally renown Zeppelin pilot and independent Hugo Eckener has won the presidency! This is a moment of celebration for our party, as his victory helps keep the Nazis at bay.

@luther_wins
on-arrival: president = "Luther"; president_party = dvp_name; new_middle_dvp += 8*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); dvp_left += 1;

Hans Luther has won the presidency! This is a moment of celebration for our party, as his victory helps us boost our popularity.

@jarres_wins
on-arrival: president = "Jarres"; president_party = dvp_name; new_middle_dvp += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 8*(1-dissent); dvp_left -= 1;

Karl Jarres has won the presidency! This is a moment of celebration for our party, as his victory helps us boost our popularity.

@braun_wins
on-arrival: president = "Braun"; president_party = spd_name; workers_spd += 5; old_middle_spd += 3; new_middle_spd += 3; rural_spd += 3; unemployed_spd += 3; pro_republic += 3; spd_left -= 1;

Otto Braun of the [+ spd_name +] has won the presidency. The [+ spd_name +] is jubilant.

@rosenfeld_wins
on-arrival: president = "Braun"; president_party = spd_name; workers_spd += 8; unemployed_spd += 8; socialism += 5; spd_left += 1;

Kurt Rosenfeld of the [+ spd_name +] has won the presidency. The <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">Socialists</span> shall continue their march towards the left.

@thalmann_wins
on-arrival: president = "Thälmann"; president_party = kpd_name;

Ernst Thälmann of the KPD has won the presidency.

- @civil_war: This is civil war.

@duesterberg_wins
on-arrival: president = "Duesterberg"; president_party = "DNF" if dnf_formed; president_party = dnvp_name if dnvp_left < 0;

What?

@hitler_wins
on-arrival: president = nsdap_candidate; president_party = "NSDAP"; chancellor = "Hitler"; chancellor_party = "NSDAP"

[? if nsdap_candidate == "Hitler" : Adolf Hitler of the NSDAP has won the presidency. He wastes no time in consolidating power. ?]
[? if nsdap_candidate != "Hitler" : The NSDAP candidate [+ president +] has won. The first action President [+ president +] takes is inviting Hitler back into Germany, and appointing him chancellor. The Nazis waste no time in consolidating power. ?]

- @hitler_takes_power: What do we do now?
